+Most tests are **browserless**: `com.vaadin:browserless-test-spring` drives the
+real Vaadin server-side components with no browser and no frontend build, so
+they run in a couple of seconds. See
 `src/test/java/com/example/customers/CustomerListViewTest.java` for the pattern.

+`CustomerListViewBrowserTest` covers what only a browser can answer — what the
+address bar says and what typing costs the backend — by driving the running
+application with Playwright through
+[Drama Finder](https://github.com/parttio/dramafinder).
